          "en": "a worker, the one who works"
        },
        {
          "ar": "مَعْمَلٌ",
          "en": "a factory or lab, the place of work"
        }
      ],
      "note": "One root gives a family of words. The faa-il pattern means the person who does the action. The maf-al pattern means the place where it happens."
